":"1625823315.072700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"usDP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"012652A0-E970-4227-824D-1E1D34BBBD00","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"そういや、fzf-prevewって実装を見たことがないんですけど、選択した項目をcdする事は可能ですか？ghqのディレクトリに飛べたら便利かな〜とか思いました。","ts":"1625823250.072100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wy9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0081258-efc2-4ebc-992e-f53d891bc22b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そう言えば tmux は `\"...\"` の代わりに `{...}` が使えるので、これを使うと if の引数とかをブロックっぽくできて少し見通しよくなったりしますね","ts":"1625823246.071900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+=iO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47862BE6-2304-43C6-BBEC-5EFE756A2CA8","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"めちゃくちゃ短い関数名をつければ良いだけか・・","ts":"1625823095.069200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y8m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1A0F8B0E-DC8D-4416-8BA6-DDD6AD714189","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"あ、そうなんですね・・（解決）","ts":"1625823028.068300","edited":{"user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","ts":"1625823112.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JTLA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17d689ed-c0e7-45ee-93f7-34f5e6b5af9c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ん、functionってそのままコマンドとして呼べますよ？","ts":"1625822951.066900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xQQ0u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FC39763A-B9AE-4459-9C4D-0034208E5055","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"もしかして自分が勘違いしてるだけで、zle -Nしたfunctionをaliasに割り当てることって出来ますか？","ts":"1625822925.066600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Hg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24F3AA56-E2A9-