block_id":"xJ4K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16551edc-b9ca-4ece-b7ad-0361a60bc779","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それもあって使いたくない","ts":"1625821448.057600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"za6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0f7a1ff-541e-4d9f-9e18-4e0b300d0855","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"tmux、謎のDSLだから辛い","ts":"1625821422.056900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":6,"users":["US90LD360","U7JL1UKKL","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS","UL6CFN8NR","U8CC7MDCL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0iP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c406ade-fbbf-4a1c-a317-c4ac76191447","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"run知らなかった。。シェル経由でできる感じですね。\nこれでやりたいことできました。ありがとうございます！\n```bind -n M-Left run \"tmux swap-window -t -1 \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux previous-window\"\nbind -n M-Right run \"tmux swap-window -t +1 \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux next-window\"```\n","ts":"1625821402.056600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U8996GYBF","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9CCd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"374e355e-e8d8-4537-ac49-7c349384afd6","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```bind -n C-h run \"($is_zsh \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-h) || ($is_vim \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-h) || ($is_fzf \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-h) || tmux select-pane -L\"\nbind -n C-j run \"($is_zsh \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-j) || ($is_vim \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-j) || ($is_fzf \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-j) || tmux select-pane -D\"\nbind -n C-k run \"($is_zsh \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-k) || ($is_vim \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-k) || ($is_fzf \u0026amp;\u0026amp; tmux send-keys C-k) || tmux select-pane -U\"\nbind -n C-l if-shell \"$is_vim\" \"send-keys C-l\"  \"select-pane -R\"```\nみたいな設定入れてるんですけどやりたいことと近いですかね？","ts":"1625821137.055100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["US90LD360"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7Aw0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1bd4a3e-40cc-493e-a95b-9cf6c05f40e1","type":"message","user":"US90LD360","text":"tmuxで現在のwindowを左右に入れ替えたいんですが、移動したときにcurrent windowも一緒に移動する方法ないですかね？\n```bind -n M-Left swap-window -t -1\nbind -n M-Right swap-window -t +1```\nこれだとwindow 1 を 0に動かしたときにcurrent windowは1の位置にいるままなので、\nイメージとしては\n```bind -n M-Left swap-window -t -1 \u0026amp;\u0026amp; next-window\nbind -n M-Right swap-window -t +1 \u0026amp;\u0026amp; next-window```\nみたいなことがしたいんですが。tmuxのbindって複数のコマンド使えるんでしょうか？","ts":"1625820942.054700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bmD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9dcfc20d-fef3-419d-85b8-cc993d026863","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"alacirtty macだと複数ウィンドウ立ち上げられなかったけど、この設定をすればいけるみたい。\n\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/pull/3461\u003e","ts":"1625782719.051400","attachments":[{"color":"6f42c1","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/pull/3461|#3461 Add Default Keybinding for SpawnNewInstance on macOS\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/pull/3461|#3461 Add Default Keybinding for SpawnNewInstance on macOS\u003e","text":"By default Command+N should open a new terminal. In addition to macOS, I'm wondering if we should add this binding on Windows too. I think on other systems it's best to avoid a default binding for this.\n\nI'll also note here, that there seems to be a bug when running `SpawnNewInstance` on a version of alacritty outside the `PATH`.","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"9","short":true},{"title":"Milestone","value":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty/milestone/13|Version 0.5.0\u003e","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/alacritty/alacritty|alacritty/alacritty\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1584214696}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"exclamation","count":1,"users":["U027BQYM708"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VMO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52890906-7E2D-4F1C-AA6F-62F6C557B5F1","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"すいません、ご飯食べて見れてなかったです。その認識であってます（めっちゃスレ違だけどつい聞いてしまいました）","ts":"1625825869.084100","thread_ts":"1625823664.075500","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b7Xqa"}]}]
